, 255);line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          风味：花香、甜橙、芒果、水蜜桃、香橼、茉莉绿茶\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;color: black;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;\">\n          Floral, Orange, Mango, Peach, Citron, Jasmine tea-like\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          这款蜜处理非常的干净顺滑，第一口喝进去就能感受到非常好非常甜的甜感和花香，口腔中弥漫着甜橙，芒果和蓝莓的混合果汁感，中温后转多汁的水蜜桃，余韵是茉莉绿茶和淡淡的香橼气息～可能会是今年最棒的埃塞蜜处理批次了！\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TYQVOuBAwWw6PNkxee7TZ26ZgQgC9qnozpX2zt0xnJmuk1h5IYt8QJIPFeB4unibb75GYcyrjS53A/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible !important;width: 677px !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystem